        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būsugi bo ng'wa Yefuta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walīho Yefuta muna Gileadi, ngosha wa būdūla mu kūlwa būlūgū. Ū ise ī lina lyakwe walī Gileadi; ū nina ūyo akamyala walī malahya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gileadi walī na nke ūyo walī wamyalīla bitūnja; aho bakūla būmpeeja ū Yefuta a ha kaya; būng'wīla, “Ū bebe ūtīko kūpandīka wingīji hamò nise ū mu kaya ya ng'wa sīswe, nguno ūlī ng'wana o nkīma ūngī.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ng'wana o nkīma ūngī:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ū saabo walī atantoolile ū nina, akangeta nda dūhū.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yefuta ūbapeela a baana ba ng'wawe, ūja kwikala kū sī ya Tobu. Aho alī kwenūko, bigela banhū bidūndūgaja būntogwa, būbiza balondeeji bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho jabīta shikū ningī, Baamoni bīīdumīla ī Isilaeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a banamhala ba Baisilaeli būja kūng'witana ū Yefuta ī Tobu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būng'wīla, “Nzūgū ūbize ntaale wa mabità gise mu būlūgū twilwishe na Baamoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yefuta ūbashokeja a banamhala ba Gileadi ūhaya, “Tūhaya a bing'we ng'walī mutanikolilwe, kūshisha ng'ūnipeeja na mu kaya ya ng'wa baba? Nibūlī ī haha mulīnikooba īkī ng'wapandīka makoye?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo a banamhala būng'wīla “Baba ka nzūgū twakūkondelaga ī haha. Tūjage tūkilwishe na a Baamoni, ūkūbiza ntaale wa banhū bose ū mu Gileadi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yefuta ūbabūūja alīhaya, “Ī gīsī ūmo mulinitwala kūjūūlwa būlūgū na a Baamoni, ū SEEBA ūlū ūbatūūla mu nkono gwane, ng'hana gete nakūbiza ntongeeji wing'we?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banamhala ba Gileadi būnshokeja būhaya, “Ū SEEBA ng'wene nkaanīji wise; tūkūgwīta gete ūyo ūlīgūhaya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yefuta ūja nabo a banamhala ba Gileadi, a banhū būūkang'wīta kūbiza ntaale na ntongeeji wabo. Pyī ī mihayo yakwe wīhayīla Mispa, kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yefuta na ntemi wa Baamoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Yefuta ūtūma nhūng'wa ū kūlī ntemi wa Baamoni alībūūja gīkī, “Ūlī na mhayo kī ū kūlī nene ūyo gūlīkwenheleja kwiza kūnidumīla mu sī yane?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi wa Baamoni ūbashokeja abo baalī baatūng'wa nū Yefuta ūhaya, “Ī shikū jene aho Baisilaeli baafumaga Misili bakīsola ī sī yane, kwandīja kū mongo gwa Alinoni kūshisha kū mongo gwa Yaboki; bīdima ī yose kūja kū mongo gwa Yolodani. Na lūūlū ni wanishokeja ī sī yane mu mhola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yefuta ūtūma hangī nhūng'wa ū kūlī ntemi wa Baamoni alīhaya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū Yefuta alīhaya gīkī, A Baisilaeli batasolile sī ya Bamoabu, nūūlū sī ya Baamoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho bafumaga Misili, a Baisilaeli bakabītīla nzīla ya kwitogolo, būkabīta kū Nyanza Yaaza, hūna būja Kadeeshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma a henaho a Baisilaeli būtūma nhūng'wa kūlī ntemi wa Edomu balīlomba gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma baanoga bandya ū lūgendo lwabo kūbītīla ng'witogolo, būjiidanda ī sī ja Edomu nī Moabu. Ī sī ya Moabu bīībīta kīya, būūkatūūla ng'hambī yabo kū ntambūko gwa mongo gwa Alinoni. Batingīlile ū mu sī ya Moabu, nguno ū mongo gwa Alinoni gwalī lūbīmbī lwa sī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma a henaho, a Baisilaeli būtwala nhūng'wa kūlī Sihoni, ntemi wa Baamooli, ūyo walī n'ikūlū lyakwe mu Heshiboni; būng'wīla gīkī, ‘Tūzunīlījage tūbīte ū mu sī yako tūlīīja kū sī yise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū Sihoni ūleka ū kūbasanya a Baisilaeli, gīkī babīte ū mu sī yakwe. Na lūūlū ūbakuminga pye a banhū bakwe kwiza kwilwisha na a Baisilaeli, būshika būtūūla ng'hambī yabo Jahazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A henaho ū Seeba, ū Mulungu wa Baisilaeli ūntūūla ū Sihoni, na a banhū bakwe pye abose mu makono ga Baisilaeli; būbapyena. Hūna a Baisilaeli bīsola ī sī ya Baamooli abo biikalaga ū mu sī yenīyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bīdima pyī ī yose kwandīja kū mongo gwa Alinoni, kūshisha gwa Yaboki, na kūfuma kwitogolo kūshika kū mongo gwa Yolodani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Seeba Mulungu wa Baisilaei īkī akabapeeja a Baamooli babīngīle a banhū bakwe a Baisilaeli, ū bebe ūlī nani nose ūbataaje ī sī yenīyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe ūtadūgije kūgelela kūshidiimīīla īsho wakwinha ū mulungu wako ū Kemoshi? H'ūmo īlī nū kū bise, nise tūkūshidimīīla īsho watwinha ū Seeba Mulungu wise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī, ū bebe ūnkīlile kī ū Balaka ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Zipooli, ūyo walī ntemi wa Moabu? Nguno ū ng'wene atalwile na a Baisilaeli, nūūlū atabayogije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha yashikaga myaka magana adatū a Baisilaeli bīsugile ī Heshboni, nī Aloe, na a magūngūli gayo, nī mizengo īyo īgwikilimbīgije ū mongo gwa Alinoni; nibūlī ūtagaagaanile kwīsola a makanza genayo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nataalī kūkūhūba mhayo gose gose, alīyo ū bebe hū ūlīnihūba; nguno ūliza kūnidumīla kwilwisha būlūgū nane. Na lūūlū ū SEEBA, ū Namuji ni abūlamulage ī lelo ū wilemeelwa ūbo būlīho a ha gatī ya Baisilaeli na a Baamoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlahīla kwa ng'wa Yefuta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū ntemi wa Amoni atagūdīlīīlile ū mhayo ūyo akatūmīlwa na Yefuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Moyo o ng'wa SEEBA ūng'wizīīla ū Yefuta, ūbīta ū mu Gileadi, nū mu sī ya lūganda lwa ng'wa Manase, ūūkingīla Mispa ya Gileadi. Ū kūfuma ī Mispa ya Gileadi, ūbasanga a Baamoni kūjūbadumīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yefuta wilahīla kūlī Seeba alīhaya, “Ūlū ūbatūūla a Baamoni mu nkono gwane; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nūshoka naabapyenaga gete a Baamoni, shose shose īsho shilafume mu kaya yane kwiza kūnisūng'wanha shikūbiza sha ng'wa SEEBA, nakūshifunya kūbiza shakwinha sha kūpemva.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yefuta ūja ū kwilwisha būlūgū nabo a Baamoni, ng'hana ū Seeba ūbatūūla mu nkono gwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkenaagūla mizengo makūmi abīlī kwandīja Aloe kūīlīīla mhandī ja Miniti, kūshisha Abeli-kelamimu. Na lūūlū a Baisilaeli būbiza bīheeba ī Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yefuta ūshoka Mispa kū kaya, aho alīshikīīla dūhū a ha kaya, nshīke wakwe ūfuma alīnsūng'wanha kūnū akūtūlaga ng'oma na kūtambīīla. Nīyo hū walī ng'wana wakwe ūmò gīko dūhū; walī atī na bangī, ndūhū ng'witūnja nūūlū nshīke ūngī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yefuta aho wamona ūtandūla ī shizwalo shakwe ūlīla alīhaya, “Agaya nshīke wane wanipīnīhaja būlī, wanigwisha kībi no! Nīyo waningīnja mu makoye ga kūniluhya hataale no! Ngūno nilahīlile mhayo kūlī Seeba ūyo natīīko gūkūkīlanhya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū nshīke ūng'wīla ū ise gīkī, “Baba ū bebe wang'wilahīlīlile SEEBA, na lūūlū īkī ū SEEBA wakūmalīlaga ī shiilī ū kū banishi bako a Baamoni, nīītīlage gīt'ūmo wilahīlīlile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ng'wanikī ūng'wīla ū ise alīhaya, ‘Gwike nalīkūlomba ūnīītīle mhayo gūmò; nizunīlījage naje kū ngūlū nakayeele yeele kwenūko ikanza lya myeji ībīlī nakūlīlaga na binhya bichaane, nguno ū nene naakīja ū kūtoolwa!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū ise ūnshokeja, “Ūdūgije ū kūja.” Ūneka ūja ikanza lya myeji ībīlī hamò na a binhya biye; būja kū ngūlū būūkalīla nang'hwe nguno ya kūkīja kūtoolwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho yabīta ī myeji īyībīlī yenīyo, ūshoka ū kūlī ise, wiza ūng'wītīla gīt'ūmo walī wilahīlīla; ataamanile ngosha ose ose ū mu būpanga bokwe. Kwandīja henaho a Baisilaeli būbiza na shīmīle sha gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "būlī ng'waka a bashīke ba Baisilaeli bayūja hanhū ikanza lya shikū inè, kūūnīla ū nshīke o ng'wa Yefuta ū muna Gileadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
